Ide:
Arduino IDE v2

Libs:
AdaFruit BusIO
Adafruit GFX Library
Adafruit SH110X
Adafruit SSD1306
Arduino_SpiNINA
U2g2

ArduinoNANO
Battery: 18650 Li-ion cell (3.7V) (Optional) (can be 2 if you want long duration)
Screen DST-013
Buzzer (optional)
2 Buttons

Wires:
SCREEN: A4 -> SDA, A5 -> SCK, 5V -> VDD, GND -> GND
Buzzer: D9 -> Buzzer+, GND -> Buzzer GND
Button 1: D3 -> any button side GND -> negative from  D3 side
Button 2; D2 -> any second button side GND -> negative from D2 side
